        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's go fishing on  Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to 4 unique fishing spots—including a rocky coast, seawall, fishing boat, and tropical pier—where the fish you encounter change depending on the location and time of day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a new high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Score Attack]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch as many fish as you can within the time limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look out for big fish to boost your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for the best lure and rod combo for each location!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Endless]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, relax, and enjoy endless fishing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the scenery shift from day to night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your gear when the situation calls and keep an eye out for big fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Ranking]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against players around the world in Score Attack and Endless modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your skills by increasing your high score and rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Battle]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against CPUs in single-player mode, or test your skills against friends in multiplayer battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Shop]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the points you've earned from fishing to buy new lures and rods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your favorite lure/rod combination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Records]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fish you catch will be recorded in your personal encyclopedia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reel in every species and complete the collection?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\